# Supply data.in and native-exported model.sus2; no checkpoint is bundled.
# Type 1 -> native species 0 (C); Masses/comments do not infer elements.
# Reinstall and rebuild for this syntax; qualify interpolated E/F/virial.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
newton on
read_data data.in
mass 1 12.0107
# table: force-consistent radial interpolation; validate against direct first.
pair_style sus2/embedded model.sus2 radial_mode table
# Optional explicit defaults (replace the preceding pair_style, do not add both):
# pair_style sus2/embedded model.sus2 radial_mode table tabstep 0.001 table_max_mb 64
# tabstep: angstrom; table_max_mb: per-rank knot storage MiB, not total RAM.
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 1.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
thermo 1
thermo_style custom step atoms pe press vol
run 0
